1
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,940
Good morning! What can I get you?

2
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:10,635
A coffee with milk, please.

3
00:00:11,585 --> 00:00:14,690
For here or to go?

4
00:00:15,890 --> 00:00:19,270
To go. I'm in a bit of a hurry.

5
00:00:19,970 --> 00:00:22,305
Sure. Anything else?

6
00:00:23,255 --> 00:00:25,975
No, thanks. How much is it?

7
00:00:27,175 --> 00:00:30,115
That's two euros fifty.

8
00:00:30,815 --> 00:00:33,590
Can I pay by card?

9
00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:36,875
Yes, no problem.

10
00:00:38,075 --> 00:00:40,960
Lena! What are you doing here?

11
00:00:41,660 --> 00:00:44,325
Marco! What a coincidence.

12
00:00:45,275 --> 00:00:47,665
Have you moved in yet?

13
00:00:48,865 --> 00:00:51,970
Not yet. I'm still looking for a flat.

14
00:00:52,670 --> 00:00:55,940
Really? And how is the search going?

15
00:00:56,890 --> 00:00:59,720
So-so. Everything is really expensive.

16
00:01:00,920 --> 00:01:03,750
I know exactly what you mean.

17
00:01:04,450 --> 00:01:07,610
I have a viewing at eleven today.

18
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:11,335
Do you want me to come with you?

19
00:01:12,535 --> 00:01:15,475
There's no need, but thanks.

20
00:01:16,175 --> 00:01:19,500
Hey, it's going to rain. Do you have an umbrella?

21
00:01:20,450 --> 00:01:23,225
No, I left it at home.

22
00:01:24,425 --> 00:01:26,980
Here, take mine.

23
00:01:27,680 --> 00:01:29,850
Are you sure?

24
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:34,345
Absolutely. Give it back to me tonight.

25
00:01:35,545 --> 00:01:37,935
OK. I owe you one.

26
00:01:38,635 --> 00:01:42,510
Don't worry about it. Shall we have dinner at nine?

27
00:01:43,460 --> 00:01:45,795
That sounds great.

28
00:01:46,995 --> 00:01:49,660
Perfect. See you later!

29
00:01:50,360 --> 00:01:52,860
Here's your coffee.

30
00:01:53,810 --> 00:01:57,410
Thank you very much. Have a nice day!

31
00:02:05,610 --> 00:02:08,440
Excuse me, could you help me?

32
00:02:09,140 --> 00:02:11,310
Of course, go ahead.

33
00:02:12,260 --> 00:02:15,255
I'm looking for the train to the city centre.

34
00:02:16,455 --> 00:02:19,065
It leaves from platform four.

35
00:02:19,765 --> 00:02:22,705
What time does the next one leave?

36
00:02:23,655 --> 00:02:27,530
At quarter past ten, but it's running late today.

37
00:02:28,730 --> 00:02:31,725
Late? How long?

38
00:02:32,425 --> 00:02:35,640
About twenty minutes, more or less.

39
00:02:36,590 --> 00:02:39,750
Oh no. I have an appointment at eleven.

40
00:02:40,950 --> 00:02:44,440
Then you'd better take the bus.

41
00:02:45,140 --> 00:02:48,190
Is the stop far from here?

42
00:02:49,140 --> 00:02:52,355
No, it's a five-minute walk.

43
00:02:53,555 --> 00:02:57,755
Go out the main door and turn left.

44
00:02:58,455 --> 00:03:01,560
And which bus do I need to take?

45
00:03:02,510 --> 00:03:06,165
The thirty-two. It comes every ten minutes.

46
00:03:07,365 --> 00:03:11,075
Could you repeat that, please? More slowly.

47
00:03:11,775 --> 00:03:15,155
The thirty-two, every ten minutes.

48
00:03:16,105 --> 00:03:19,595
Perfect. Thank you very much for your help.

49
00:03:20,795 --> 00:03:23,350
You're welcome. Have a good trip!

50
00:03:24,050 --> 00:03:26,770
Mrs Ortiz? It's Lena.

51
00:03:27,720 --> 00:03:31,210
I'm sorry, I'm going to be a bit late.

52
00:03:32,410 --> 00:03:35,845
That's fine. I'll wait for you at the entrance.

53
00:03:36,545 --> 00:03:39,320
Thank you for your patience.

54
00:03:47,270 --> 00:03:50,265
Come in, come in. This is the living room.

55
00:03:51,465 --> 00:03:53,635
It's so bright!

56
00:03:54,335 --> 00:03:58,100
It faces south, so it gets sun all afternoon.

57
00:03:59,050 --> 00:04:01,990
How many bedrooms does it have?

58
00:04:03,190 --> 00:04:06,075
Two bedrooms and a bathroom.

59
00:04:06,775 --> 00:04:09,330
Can I see the kitchen?

60
00:04:10,280 --> 00:04:13,660
Of course. It has just been renovated.

61
00:04:14,860 --> 00:04:17,910
How much is the rent per month?

62
00:04:18,610 --> 00:04:21,990
Eight hundred euros, bills included.

63
00:04:22,940 --> 00:04:25,660
Does that include heating?

64
00:04:26,860 --> 00:04:29,855
Yes, the heating and the water.

65
00:04:30,555 --> 00:04:33,165
Is there a deposit?

66
00:04:34,115 --> 00:04:36,615
Two months' deposit.

67
00:04:37,815 --> 00:04:40,370
Are pets allowed?

68
00:04:41,070 --> 00:04:44,065
It depends. What pet do you have?

69
00:04:45,015 --> 00:04:47,625
A very calm cat.

70
00:04:48,825 --> 00:04:51,490
A cat is no problem.

71
00:04:52,190 --> 00:04:55,075
When would it be available?

72
00:04:56,025 --> 00:04:58,580
From the first of the month.

73
00:04:59,780 --> 00:05:03,325
There's someone else interested, to be honest.

74
00:05:04,025 --> 00:05:06,855
I understand. Let me think about it.

75
00:05:07,805 --> 00:05:10,800
Of course. Will you let me know tomorrow?

76
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:15,160
Yes, I'll write to you tomorrow without fail.

77
00:05:15,860 --> 00:05:18,745
Very good. Oh, look how it's raining!

78
00:05:19,695 --> 00:05:22,690
Good thing I have an umbrella.

79
00:05:30,890 --> 00:05:34,435
Good afternoon. How can I help you?

80
00:05:35,135 --> 00:05:37,910
I'm not feeling very well.

81
00:05:38,860 --> 00:05:40,975
What's wrong?

82
00:05:42,175 --> 00:05:45,830
My throat hurts and I'm very tired.

83
00:05:46,530 --> 00:05:48,700
Since when?

84
00:05:49,650 --> 00:05:52,370
Since last night.

85
00:05:53,570 --> 00:05:55,740
Do you have a fever?

86
00:05:56,440 --> 00:05:59,710
I don't think so, but I'm not sure.

87
00:06:00,660 --> 00:06:04,645
I recommend these throat lozenges.

88
00:06:05,845 --> 00:06:08,730
Take one every four hours.

89
00:06:09,430 --> 00:06:12,920
Can I take them on an empty stomach?

90
00:06:13,870 --> 00:06:16,535
Better after eating.

91
00:06:17,735 --> 00:06:20,125
And drink plenty of water.

92
00:06:20,825 --> 00:06:23,105
And if I don't get better?

93
00:06:24,055 --> 00:06:27,765
If you don't improve in three days, go to the doctor.

94
00:06:28,965 --> 00:06:31,905
All right. How much do I owe you?

95
00:06:32,605 --> 00:06:35,215
Six euros twenty.

96
00:06:36,165 --> 00:06:38,170
Here you are.

97
00:06:39,370 --> 00:06:41,540
Get well soon.

98
00:06:42,240 --> 00:06:44,740
Thank you, that's very kind.

99
00:06:52,690 --> 00:06:55,850
Finally! I thought you weren't coming.

100
00:06:57,050 --> 00:07:00,100
Sorry, I'm late again.

101
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:04,015
Don't worry. I've just arrived.

102
00:07:04,965 --> 00:07:08,620
Here's your umbrella. It saved my life.

103
00:07:09,820 --> 00:07:12,265
How did the viewing go?

104
00:07:12,965 --> 00:07:15,960
Very well. I love the flat.

105
00:07:16,910 --> 00:07:19,025
And the price?

106
00:07:20,225 --> 00:07:23,385
A bit expensive, but it's worth it.

107
00:07:24,085 --> 00:07:26,475
Are you going to take it?

108
00:07:27,425 --> 00:07:31,135
I think so. I'll write to the owner tomorrow.

109
00:07:32,335 --> 00:07:35,550
Congratulations! We have to celebrate.

110
00:07:36,250 --> 00:07:38,585
What will you have?

111
00:07:39,535 --> 00:07:42,035
What do you recommend?

112
00:07:43,235 --> 00:07:46,230
The paella is very good today.

113
00:07:46,930 --> 00:07:49,870
Then two paellas, please.

114
00:07:50,820 --> 00:07:53,870
And a bottle of still water.

115
00:07:55,070 --> 00:07:57,020
Right away.

116
00:07:57,720 --> 00:08:01,045
Hey, are you OK? You don't look well.

117
00:08:01,995 --> 00:08:05,265
I've got a bit of a cold, that's all.

118
00:08:06,465 --> 00:08:09,955
You should rest this weekend.

119
00:08:10,655 --> 00:08:14,530
You're right. But I have a thousand things to do.

120
00:08:15,480 --> 00:08:18,695
Shall I give you a hand with the move?

121
00:08:19,895 --> 00:08:22,890
Really? That would be great.

122
00:08:23,590 --> 00:08:26,805
Of course. That's what friends are for.

123
00:08:27,755 --> 00:08:30,365
I owe you one, again.

124
00:08:31,565 --> 00:08:34,780
You owe me two. But who's counting?

125
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:38,365
What do you mean by that?

126
00:08:39,315 --> 00:08:42,530
That you buy me the next dinner.

127
00:08:43,730 --> 00:08:45,790
It's a deal.

128
00:08:46,490 --> 00:08:49,430
Here you are. Enjoy your meal!

129
00:08:50,380 --> 00:08:52,715
That looks delicious!

130
00:08:53,915 --> 00:08:56,305
To the new flat.

131
00:08:57,005 --> 00:08:58,790
Cheers!

132
00:08:59,740 --> 00:09:02,735
By the way, is it still raining?

133
00:09:03,935 --> 00:09:05,940
It's pouring.

134
00:09:06,640 --> 00:09:10,350
Then you're lending me the umbrella again.

135
00:09:11,300 --> 00:09:14,845
No way. This time I'll walk you home.

136
00:09:16,045 --> 00:09:18,105
You're a sweetheart.
